  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.1",
      "verse_number": 1,
      "en": "Although all inspiration goeth from Me to all the living, directly, yet I also created man susceptible to indirect inspiration from all My creations.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.2",
      "verse_number": 2,
      "en": "Whatsoever receiveth from Me direct, is in harmony with Me.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.3",
      "verse_number": 3,
      "en": "The lily and the rose I created perfect in their order; the female bird I inspire to build her nest in season, perfect in her order.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.4",
      "verse_number": 4,
      "en": "Even so is it with all My created beings, save man. All the rest err not, in the order I made them; and they all fulfill the glory for which I made them.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.5",
      "verse_number": 5,
      "en": "But because I made man capacitated to receive inspiration from all things, he manifesteth both, evil and good; according to his birth and surroundings, so is man good or bad.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.6",
      "verse_number": 6,
      "en": "Nevertheless, I created man with capacity to comprehend this also; for, I designed him, from the first, to work his way up to the Godhead, understanding all below him.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.7",
      "verse_number": 7,
      "en": "And I sent my angels to man, teaching him how to distinguish the difference in the inspirations upon him, that he might govern himself accordingly.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.8",
      "verse_number": 8,
      "en": "And My angels said unto man: Become thou one with thy Creator; these are His direct inspirations:",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.9",
      "verse_number": 9,
      "en": "To love thy Creator above all else, and thy neighbor as thyself.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.10",
      "verse_number": 10,
      "en": "To give delights only, and not pain.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.11",
      "verse_number": 11,
      "en": "To kill not.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.12",
      "verse_number": 12,
      "en": "To do not violently against His creatures.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.13",
      "verse_number": 13,
      "en": "To be considerate of the liberty of all the living.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.14",
      "verse_number": 14,
      "en": "To interdict not the happiness and hope of others, only where thou canst return a transcendent glory and hope in place thereof.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.15",
      "verse_number": 15,
      "en": "For these are direct inspirations from thy Creator.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.16",
      "verse_number": 16,
      "en": "But these are thy evil inspirations, O man, these come from thy birth and surroundings, formerly called, satan:",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.17",
      "verse_number": 17,
      "en": "To kill.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.18",
      "verse_number": 18,
      "en": "To slander.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.19",
      "verse_number": 19,
      "en": "To punish.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.20",
      "verse_number": 20,
      "en": "To destroy Jehovih's created beings.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.21",
      "verse_number": 21,
      "en": "To strive for thyself, above another.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.22",
      "verse_number": 22,
      "en": "To gratify thy flesh at the expense of purity or wisdom.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.23",
      "verse_number": 23,
      "en": "To be false to Jehovih.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.24",
      "verse_number": 24,
      "en": "To be false to thyself.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.25",
      "verse_number": 25,
      "en": "To speak falsely.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.26",
      "verse_number": 26,
      "en": "To covet another's.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.27",
      "verse_number": 27,
      "en": "To cohabit in the gestative period.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "inspiration.8.28",
      "verse_number": 28,
      "en": "To engage in strife, or to aid and abet conflicts, which are the fruit of carnivorous food, transmitted in birth.",
      "zh_hant": null,
      "zh_hans": null,
      "ja": null,
      "glossary_terms": [],
      "plate_ref": null,
      "notes": []
    }
  ]
}
